stateDiagram
    mqtt: mqtt_task
    microrl: microrl_task
    sensor_controller: sensor_reader_task
    statemachine: conveyor_job_task
    motor_controller: motor_controller_task
    PID_controller: future PID controller
    encoders: future encoders
    sensors: S0/S1 BGS sensors
    motors: MD30C + motor

    mqtt --> statemachine : JSON top-level commands
    statemachine --> mqtt : tray presence + job feedback
    microrl --> statemachine : jobtx/jobrx/estop/clearerror
    microrl --> statemachine : gettray status query
    microrl --> motor_controller : debug PWM commands through motor state
    statemachine --> motor_controller : move/stop requests through motor state
    motor_controller --> motors : GPIO direction + LEDC PWM
    sensor_controller --> statemachine : active-low sensor state
    sensors --> sensor_controller : GPIO input
    encoder_filter: encoder_filter
    encoders --> encoder_filter : raw encoder count
    encoder_filter --> PID_controller : filtered encoder count
    PID_controller --> motor_controller : future closed-loop motor request
    motor_controller --> PID_controller : future current motor state
